OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for more than 10 years
OL,4,Afor raping woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped and assaulted a woman
OL,7,Fin Stoke-on-Trent has been jailed for
OL,8,F10 years and six months.
OL,10,FShaun Daniels, 38, of no fixed address,
OL,11,Fwas sentenced on Tuesday after being
OL,12,Ffound guilty of two counts of rape,
OL,13,Fassault by beating and actual bodily
OL,14,Fharm during a trial in the city.
OL,16,FHe was placed on the sex offenders
OL,17,Fregister and made subject to an
OL,18,Findefinite restraining order to protect
OL,19,Fthe victim.
